@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# React Compiler (experimental)
+
+Both integrations are opt-in-friendly and toggleable. Goal is exploration + filing upstream bugs, not shipping stable behavior.
+
+- **Build compilation** — `scripts/build.ts` passes `reactCompiler: true` to `Bun.build` (Bun 1.4+ native, no Babel/plugin). Produces `_c(N)` memo cache calls + `react/compiler-runtime` imports in `dist/`. Off via `REACT_COMPILER=0`. Runs **only in the prod bundler** — `bun --hot` dev server uses the runtime transpiler and is unaffected (DevTools "Memo ✨" badge visible on a prod build, not in dev). Cannot fail the build: Bun falls back to original source on any compiler bailout/parse error. Known limit: sourcemaps map to the compiled intermediate, not original lines. The Dockerfile builds with `bun --bun run build`.
+- **Lint diagnostics** — `biome.json` enables `nursery.useReactCompiler: "warn"`. Biome embeds the React Compiler Rust port — no `babel-plugin-react-compiler` dep. The rule runs only when the nearest `package.json` declares React ≥19 (satisfied). `warn` severity surfaces violations in `bun run check` without failing the gate (Biome exits non-zero only on errors). `compilationMode` default `infer` (only components/hooks). Tracked upstream: biomejs/biome#10974.
+- **Type gap** — `@types/bun`/`bun-types` do not yet declare `reactCompiler`/`reactCompilerOutputMode` on `BuildConfig`. `scripts/build.ts` is outside `tsconfig.json` `include`, so `bun run typecheck` does not see it; the editor may flag those lines until types ship.
+- **Verify it ran** — `rm -rf dist && bun run build && F=$(ls dist/chunk-*.js) && grep -c memo_cache_sentinel "$F"` → expect `2` (compiler on). With `REACT_COMPILER=0` expect `1`. Under minify the `react/compiler-runtime` import string is renamed, so the `memo_cache_sentinel` count is the robust signal (the delta vs the 1-sentinel React baseline).
+- **File bugs at** — https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues (compiler output correctness, fallback behavior) and https://github.com/biomejs/biome/issues/10974 (diagnostic parity/false positives).
